        <li><a href="/pages/b2c" class="footer-link"><i class="fas fa-chevron-right"></i> Why Vidhyut Saathi</a></li>
        <li><a href="/policies/privacy-policy" class="footer-link"><i class="fas fa-chevron-right"></i> Privacy Policy</a></li>
